CORE
main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* bool: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* static_cast bool: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] .* double: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] .* float: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.5\] .* functional cast: SUCCESS$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
N5008 [expr.static.cast]/9: a value of integral type, which includes bool, or
of floating-point type explicitly converts to an enumeration type (a
floating-point value via the enumeration's underlying type).
